description: Use when Codex works from a Kanban board with task dependencies, review handoffs, blocked-card rework loops, heartbeats, blocker comments, project-scope guardrails, [Codex]-marked ticket ownership, or parallel subagent/workstream coordination; especially when a user provides dependency streams, asks for maximum safe parallelism, or uses Hermes-style Kanban review.
